/v1/","context":{"app_id":2341620,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2341620","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:31:53Z","value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3152510","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2341620-1844751498232925","game_id":"steam-2341620","kind":"announcement","title":"Fall Updates","summary":"Happy Fall!I hope everyone had a good summer. I've been working really hard to finish Alpine Lake as soon as possible and I have some good news! Alpine Lake will be receiving an updated demo for the upcoming October Steam Next Fest!Here are some of my end of summer updates!You can now own a dog AND a cat!30k+ words of dialogueover 200 hand crafted decorationsover 100 building materials to customize your inns31 unique zones to explore73 total quests to completeover 50 unique NPC's to meetYou also","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T01:52:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2341620-1832700592787727","game_id":"steam-2341620","kind":"announcement","title":"2026 Updates","summary":"Hi everyone!It's been almost a year since my last steam update I just wanted to update everyone on the current state of Alpine Lake.Over the last year I've been working really hard to add content to the game way beyond what was seen in the demo, such as:A full story narrativeover 170 hand crafted decorationsover 70 building materials to customize your innsnew areas with unique resources to collect and animals to photographcompletely redesigned build mode so it's all in one menuimproved interacti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T23:59:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592787727","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2341620-1802893906743053","game_id":"steam-2341620","kind":"announcement","title":"2025 Updates","summary":"Happy June!I just wanted to drop a quick update on Alpine Lake progress this year! There are so many fun additions to the game that I'm very excited to share. Steady progress is being made every day and your patience for the game is much appreciated!SkiingDid you know that near town is actually an old ski resort that needs your help? After a few simple repairs you'll be able to access this new unique skiing mini-game!Alpine Regional TrailIn the demo there were about 10 animals you could photogra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-19T22:44:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802893906743053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2341620-6240387642454341892","game_id":"steam-2341620","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Here!","summary":"I'm very thankful for everyone who's experienced the Alpine Lake Demo! Almost 1000 of you have played and I've been listening to all the feedback I've come across! Here are some updates to the demo. Stamina Usage: The stamina system has been rebalanced to provide a less punishing experience. No longer will stamina be used when you miss a tree with your axe, or a stone with your pick axe. (swinging the machete will still consume stamina every time regardless) Pause Menu Map: The map in the pause ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-29T13:14:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6240387642454341892","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2341620-5747233970420662193","game_id":"steam-2341620","kind":"announcement","title":"Exciting Updates for Alpine Lake","summary":"Hello Alpine Lake Community, I'm very excited to announce that Alpine Lake has officially entered its closed alpha phase! I appreciate the support from our dedicated players and can’t wait for you to explore the latest additions. New Cave System: Discover the mysteries beneath Alpine Lake with our newly added cave system. Unearth hidden treasures and face exciting challenges as you delve deep underground. Visitor Center & Museum Collection System: Visit the new Visitor Center where you can showc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-05-17T03:20:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5747233970420662193","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2341620-5219165352621952448","game_id":"steam-2341620","kind":"announcement","title":"Social Interaction is Healthy!","summary":"Hello! Andrew here! I wanted to share a convenient place to find all the fun ways to following along during this development process. https://www.twitch.tv/booyagrandmma I stream every Tuesday and Thursday at 10am est / 7am pst. You never know what kind of behind the scenes stuff I'll be working on! Sometimes it's implementing a new features or creating a fun new decoration. https://twitter.com/MossyGroveGames I like to use twitter to post quick screen shots of content created on stream. https:/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2023-09-21T01:25:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5219165352621952448","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2341620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2341620":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2341620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z"},"3152510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:13Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2341620","app_id":2341620,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1447c7862651449c7eb590d81f84d7ce248d78f44a4a670dbb5252a15aa1ebca","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Build, decorate, and customize every detail of your inn to welcome guests to your cozy escape in the woods. Entertain tourists, farm, cook meals, research wildlife, and ski, all while helping a colorful cast of townspeople save the struggling mountain town from a hostile takeover.","publishers":[{"name":"Mossy Grove Games","creator_clan_account_id":43729372}],"developers":[{"name":"Mossy Grove Games","creator_clan_account_id":43729372}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"2026 Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791781065","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filenam